# The rules every PR is graded by: the pre-flight gate, the check scripts and the
# workflows that run them. CI runs the base branch's copy of these, so an app's PR
# cannot relax its own checks; this file makes sure a change to the rules themselves
# is reviewed by a maintainer before it lands.
#
# Only enforced with "Require review from Code Owners" on the develop and main
# branch rules.

/gate/          @ahansson89 @oauramos @alberto-ah2
/scripts/       @ahansson89 @oauramos @alberto-ah2
/.github/       @ahansson89 @oauramos @alberto-ah2

